<!-- Olife status in the game (UX B, 16.10, olife_menu): the same ids as layouts/pages/olife_status.xml (menu page), shown as a
     permanent HUD element (hud.open_permanent) only while there is something to show: packs on the fly, world reopen for
     packs, "the world is restarting, hold on", reconnect phases, a lost connection. Draws olife_client:status. -->
